@startuml
!theme plain
|a_default| Default
|a_default|
start
:Initially, it is important to check the Referee Reports.;
:At the same time,;
:monitor if the Referee Reports have been completed;
:v1: reports_completed ({Yes, No}); <<objectSignal>>
if () then ([v1 = "Yes"])
:If they have been completed,;
else ([v1 = "No"])
:flag it and send a reminder;
repeat :;
:check again if the Referee Reports have been completed;
:v2: recheck_completed ({Yes, No}); <<objectSignal>>
backward:flag it again and send another reminder.;
repeat while () is ([v2 = "No"]) not ([v2 = "Yes"])
:If they have,;
endif
:organizing interviews for the Selection Panel with the top candidates;
:receive feedback from the interview candidates;
:check if a Psychometric Test is required;
:v3: psycho_required ({Yes, No}); <<objectSignal>>
if () then ([v3 = "Yes"])
:If it is,;
:check if an HR Specialist is required;
:v4: hr_required ({Yes, No}); <<objectSignal>>
if () then ([v4 = "Yes"])
:If an HR Specialist is required,;
:schedule the test with a third party;
else ([v4 = "No"])
:complete the Psychometric Test;
endif
else ([v3 = "No"])
:coordinate the second round of selection;
endif
:Finally, you should request the final candidate ranking and continue with the process.;
stop
@enduml